What is a Power Quality Analyzer?
A Power Quality Analyzer is a professional measurement instrument used for recording and analyzing various power quality issues such as harmonics, voltage fluctuations, flicker, power parameters, and three-phase imbalances in electrical grids. These sophisticated devices provide critical performance evaluation and management decisions essential for modern electrical infrastructure, including smart power grids, renewable energy installations, electric railway systems, and large-scale industrial applications where power reliability is non-negotiable.
